  "solution": {
    "text": "According to first law of thermodynamics\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& Q=d U-W \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow Q=d U-\\left[-P_{\\text {external }}\\left(V_f-V_i\\right)\\right]\n\\end{aligned}$\n[In Adiabatic Process $Q=0$, In Free expansion $P_{\\text {extermal }}=0$ ]\n$\\therefore$ Putting the values, we get $\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{dU}=0 \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{U}=\\mathrm{constant}$\nAs internal energy remains unchanged; temperature must be constant.\n$\\therefore$ Isothermal Process",
